  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 5358,
      "text": "So Today he will have no close friend here,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 35,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 568,
      "ruku": 500,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5359,
      "text": "nor any food except the discharge of wounds,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 36,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 568,
      "ruku": 500,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5360,
      "text": "none will eat it except the sinners.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 37,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 568,
      "ruku": 500,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5361,
      "text": "I swear by what you can see.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 38,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 568,
      "ruku": 501,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5362,
      "text": "and what you cannot see!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 39,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 568,
      "ruku": 501,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5363,
      "text": "Indeed, this is the word of a noble Messenger[8],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 40,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 568,
      "ruku": 501,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5364,
      "text": "and it is not the word of a poet; little do you believe!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 41,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 568,
      "ruku": 501,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5365,
      "text": "Nor is it the word of a soothsayer; little do you take heed!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 42,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 568,
      "ruku": 501,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5366,
      "text": "It is a revelation from the Lord of the worlds.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 43,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 568,
      "ruku": 501,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5367,
      "text": "If he had falsely attributed something to Us,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 44,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 568,
      "ruku": 501,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5368,
      "text": "We would have surely seized him by the right hand[9],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 45,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 568,
      "ruku": 501,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5369,
      "text": "then severed his aorta[10],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 46,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 568,
      "ruku": 501,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5370,
      "text": "and none of you could have rescued him.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 47,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 568,
      "ruku": 501,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5371,
      "text": "This [Qur’an] is indeed a reminder for those who are righteous.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 48,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 568,
      "ruku": 501,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5372,
      "text": "And We surely know that some of you will be deniers,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 49,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 568,
      "ruku": 501,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5373,
      "text": "and it[11] will certainly be a source of regret for the disbelievers.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 50,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 568,
      "ruku": 501,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5374,
      "text": "And this[12] is indeed the absolute truth.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 51,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 568,
      "ruku": 501,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5375,
      "text": "So glorify the name of your Lord, the Most Great.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 52,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 568,
      "ruku": 501,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5376,
      "text": "A challenger asked for a punishment bound to come[1]",
      "surah": {
        "number": 70,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المَعَارِجِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Ma'aarij",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Ascending Stairways",
        "numberOfAyahs": 44,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 1,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 568,
      "ruku": 502,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5377,
      "text": "upon the disbelievers, which none can avert,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 70,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المَعَارِجِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Ma'aarij",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Ascending Stairways",
        "numberOfAyahs": 44,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 2,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 568,
      "ruku": 502,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5378,
      "text": "from Allah, Lord of the pathways of ascent,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 70,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المَعَارِجِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Ma'aarij",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Ascending Stairways",
        "numberOfAyahs": 44,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 3,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 568,
      "ruku": 502,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5379,
      "text": "by which the angels and the Spirit[2] will ascend to Him on a Day[3] the length of which is fifty thousand years.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 70,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المَعَارِجِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Ma'aarij",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Ascending Stairways",
        "numberOfAyahs": 44,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 4,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 568,
      "ruku": 502,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5380,
      "text": "So be patient [O Prophet] with beautiful patience.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 70,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المَعَارِجِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Ma'aarij",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Ascending Stairways",
        "numberOfAyahs": 44,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 5,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 568,
      "ruku": 502,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5381,
      "text": "Indeed, they see this [punishment] far off,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 70,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المَعَارِجِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Ma'aarij",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Ascending Stairways",
        "numberOfAyahs": 44,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 6,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 568,
      "ruku": 502,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5382,
      "text": "but We see it to be close at hand.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 70,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المَعَارِجِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Ma'aarij",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Ascending Stairways",
        "numberOfAyahs": 44,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 7,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 568,
      "ruku": 502,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5383,
      "text": "On the Day when the sky will be like molten brass[4]",
      "surah": {
        "number": 70,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المَعَارِجِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Ma'aarij",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Ascending Stairways",
        "numberOfAyahs": 44,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 8,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 568,
      "ruku": 502,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5384,
      "text": "and the mountains will be like dyed wool[5],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 70,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المَعَارِجِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Ma'aarij",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Ascending Stairways",
        "numberOfAyahs": 44,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 9,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 568,
      "ruku": 502,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5385,
      "text": "and no close friend will ask about another,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 70,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المَعَارِجِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Ma'aarij",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Ascending Stairways",
